# Router - chainkit stage

Stage `route` on model `qwen3.5:4b`. Prompt of record: `agents/router.md`.

RECONCILED 2026-09-03 (TASKS 8.1). `permission` is DERIVED from this
seat's `May Call` clearance and the declared wall of every skill it may
call -- never asserted separately. A seat's reach IS the union of what
its tools may touch, and writing it any other way is how the Router came
to declare `read: agent_workspace/** only` while cleared for `all`, which
includes the ground readers. Ten of the eleven records that existed
before this pass also named a model the seat had not run in weeks.

A seat with no `May Call` line holds NO tools: it reads nothing, writes
nothing and reaches nothing. That is most of this roster, and it is the
reason the estate can say a seat never touches the filesystem.

```json
{
  "can_approve": false,
  "covenant": "1512741580b7239b",
  "id": "chain_router",
  "kind": "agent",
  "may_call": [
